# [DD-13b.W1.3] COMPOSITION, and the three tiers in one file.
#
# `piece` NAMES one group (DELIVERED: a groups[] row whose ref is "piece"),
# references one by number (HIDDEN: a slot, no row), and leaves one unnamed
# and unread (ERASED: the A_CAP is deleted and it spends no number at all).
# The caller declares no group of its own, so `ngroups` is 0 and every slot
# above it belongs to the definition — which is what makes `nentries >
# nnames` observable here for the first time in this tree.
target = user

pattern ^(?&piece)$
name user

pattern (?<kept>a)(b)(c)\2
name piece
